[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3480.309, "timestamp": "00:58:00", "text": "不。我想這應該是日本文化裡的一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3486.549, "timestamp": "00:58:06", "text": "庫拉蘇（kurasu）。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3489.349, "timestamp": "00:58:09", "text": "沒有 kuras。哦，這個人。某人。某人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3515.19, "timestamp": "00:58:35", "text": "呃，忘了這個漢字。我對此非常清楚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3533.27, "timestamp": "00:58:53", "text": "[音樂]"}]